// Power-Thrust: authored red weapon-empowerment cast flash for EF_OVERTHRUST.
// The reference establishes the sound but no native STR; this is an
// approximation, not a duration-bound weapon tint or status aura: a red body
// flash and rising rays, a sword emblem lifting over the head with a starburst
// behind it, and a few ember streaks. Soft-edged billboard textures only.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the caster's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn.
(
    fps: 30,
    layers: [
        // Ground shockwave.
        (
            textures: ["ro://data/texture/effect/glow11.bmp"],
            blend: Add,
            keys: [
                (at: 0, offset: (319.0, 291.0), quad: (40.0, 12.0), color: (255, 110, 60, 0)),
                (at: 2, offset: (319.0, 291.0), quad: (130.0, 38.0), color: (255, 120, 70, 255)),
                (at: 14, offset: (319.0, 291.0), quad: (210.0, 60.0), color: (255, 80, 40, 0)),
            ],
        ),
        // Rising aura rays behind the body.
